{"id":11459,"global_id":"sherwoodcharterschool.org?id=11459","global_id_lineage":["sherwoodcharterschool.org?id=11459"],"author":"2","status":"publish","date":"2025-05-01 16:01:27","date_utc":"2025-05-01 23:01:27","modified":"2025-05-29 13:20:52","modified_utc":"2025-05-29 20:20:52","url":"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/event\/stepping-stones-ceremony-6\/","rest_url":"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-json\/tribe\/events\/v1\/events\/11459","title":"Stepping Stones Ceremony","description":"<p>Each year at SCS we celebrate the completion of the elementary grades with a \u201cStepping Stones Ceremony.\u201d The Stepping Stones Ceremony is a tradition where the teacher speaks about the class and the students. Students are given a stone memento with their grade to signify completing the year followed by a symbolic advancement to the next grade. It is a wonderful closure and the stones become keepsakes that they collect every year.<\/p>\n<p>All families are encouraged to attend the Stepping Stones Ceremony for their student\u2019s grade. Students should arrive at school in uniform or nicer clothing at normal time (7:40-7:55 am), with morning car line drop off as usual. Students will remain with their class until their ceremony. Parents should arrive a few minutes before their student\u2019s grade is scheduled to begin. Once the whole class has advanced to the next grade level, families will be directed into the school gym where they should check out their student with the designated staff member. After your student has been checked out, there will be a brief opportunity to take pictures before officially starting summer. If you are unable to attend the Stepping Stones event and will not be picking up your student directly after the ceremony, please note that there will be <strong>NO<\/strong> dismissal through car line on this day. Parents must park and check into the office to pick up student beginning at 11:30 and no later than noon. See the schedule below:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>8:20 \u2013 Doors open for Kindergarten Graduation seating<\/li>\n<li>8:30-9:00 \u2013\u00a0Kindergarten Graduation<\/li>\n<li>9:00-9:15 \u2013 Transition to\u00a0Stepping Stones Ceremonies<\/li>\n<li>9:15-9:35 \u2013 First Grade<\/li>\n<li>9:40-10:00 \u2013 Second Grade<\/li>\n<li>10:05-10:25 \u2013 Third Grade<\/li>\n<li>10:30-10:50 \u2013 Fourth Grade<\/li>\n<li>10:50-11:00 \u2013 Transition to Fifth Grade Promotion<\/li>\n<li>11:00-11:30 \u2013\u00a0Fifth Grade Promotion<\/li>\n<li>11:30-12:00 \u2013 Wrap Up and Dismissal<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<p><a ref=\"magnificPopup\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11539\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg 232w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025-791x1024.jpg 791w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025-1187x1536.jpg 1187w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025-768x994.jpg 768w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/KG-Graduation-Flyer-2025.jpg 1275w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 232px) 100vw, 232px\" \/>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0<\/a><a ref=\"magnificPopup\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11535\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg 232w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025-791x1024.jpg 791w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025-1187x1536.jpg 1187w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025-768x994.jpg 768w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/Stepping-Stones-Flyer-2025.jpg 1275w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 232px) 100vw, 232px\" \/><\/a><a ref=\"magnificPopup\" href=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025.jpg\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-11538\" src=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"232\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025-232x300.jpg 232w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025-791x1024.jpg 791w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025-1187x1536.jpg 1187w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025-768x994.jpg 768w, https:\/\/sherwoodcharterschool.org\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/05\/5th-Promotion-Flyer-2025.jpg 1275w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 232px) 100vw, 232px\" \/><\/a><\/p>","excerpt":"","slug":"stepping-stones-ceremony-6","image":false,"all_day":true,"start_date":"2025-06-05 00:00:00","start_date_details":{"year":"2025","month":"06","day":"05","hour":"00","minutes":"00","seconds":"00"},"end_date":"2025-06-05 23:59:59","end_date_details":{"year":"2025","month":"06","day":"05","hour":"23","minutes":"59","seconds":"59"},"utc_start_date":"2025-06-05 07:00:00","utc_start_date_details